# Pinned upstream sources for the vendored build patterns.
# Format: local-path|raw-url-on-default-branch|pinned-sha|note
# The drift action compares pinned-sha with the latest upstream commit for the
# file, then diffs the local copy against the current upstream content.
build/Dockerfile|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hecknt/makepkg-action/main/Dockerfile|6efd785524d744425796e65971a0c5db1b54c9ef|copied, explicit chmod on entrypoint.sh
build/entrypoint.sh|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hecknt/makepkg-action/main/entrypoint.sh|6efd785524d744425796e65971a0c5db1b54c9ef|copied, shellcheck-safe loop
build/system_files/etc/pacman.conf|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hecknt/makepkg-action/main/system_files/etc/pacman.conf|6efd785524d744425796e65971a0c5db1b54c9ef|copied verbatim
build/system_files/etc/makepkg.conf|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hecknt/makepkg-action/main/system_files/etc/makepkg.conf|6efd785524d744425796e65971a0c5db1b54c9ef|copied verbatim
packages/bootc/PKGBUILD|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hecknt/arch-bootc-pkgs/main/pkgs/bootc/PKGBUILD|8f82efe20229b363f69ace0d3590d369a3f33b17|copied, pkgver pinned by renovate
